                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='44' forceUpdate='true' h='5778' id='41' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='45916' x='667' y='26333'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c40c0b' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='16'>Value Proposition</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='396' forceUpdate='true' h='44889' id='42' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='45916' x='667' y='32111'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Who is the end-user? What are their objectives? How will they benefit from having the competitors dashboard? Mention workflow/interfaces.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Pricing and Category Managers are the users of the model.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> Their task is to </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>set pricing by using competitors data</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> as one of the input factors.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Being able to access competitors data will enable us to:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Track our positioning against competitor continuously and make sure we maintain it throughout time.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Measure our value proposition and be able to focus on positioning in the market.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Set competitive prices for our SKUs against competitors with greater precision.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#c40c0b' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='dashed' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='33' h='63000' id='38' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='3417' x='46583' y='14000'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='592' h='63000' id='43' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49333' x='50000' y='14000'>
                <zone h='12333' id='44' is-scaled='1' param='Image/pipeline.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='49333' x='50000' y='14000'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='44' forceUpdate='true' h='5778' id='45' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='49333' x='50000' y='26333'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c40c0b' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='16'>Data Pipeline</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='396' forceUpdate='true' h='44889' id='46' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='49333' x='50000' y='32111'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' italic='true'>What is the scrapping process like?</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Steps (3 to 6 weeks process):</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Data Scrapping</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>: Attaining all competitors data from their website or application through the data scraping processes of the four competitor data providers.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Product Matching:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> Providers, except </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' italic='true'>DataHen</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>, match all competitor products scraped to DH products and provide the list of matched products.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Product Matching Algorithm (Automatic process for unmatched </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>DataHen</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' underline='true'> data):</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> Predicting matches of assortment with competitors assortment through Levenshtein string-based algorithm.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Manual Validation:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'> Validating the matched data by data providers and the automatic process at DH of matching </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11' italic='true'>DataHen </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>data. With the support from reports local teams manually validate the matching results and indicate whether or not the products from our assortment vs. competitors assortment are indeed a match.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#c40c0b' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='dashed' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='76' forceUpdate='true' h='9333' id='13' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='77000'>
